# Trivy ignore file — Phase 20.5 WS-B6.
#
# Format: one CVE per line, optionally followed by an expiry date and reason.
# Anything listed here will be skipped by `trivy fs` and `trivy image`.
#
# Keep this file empty unless we have a documented reason to accept a CVE.
# Each entry MUST include:
#   1. The CVE / GHSA / ID
#   2. The package + version pinned
#   3. The reason (transitive dep, no upstream fix yet, etc.)
#   4. A link to the security ticket tracking remediation
#   5. An expiry date (yyyy-mm-dd) when the suppression must be revisited
#
# Example format:
#   CVE-2024-12345  expires 2026-12-31  reason="no upstream fix; tracked in #1234"

# End of file.
